hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"97","[AI-translation] Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne itne aur itne [arse] se apni sharmgah se qible ki taraf rukh nahin kiya. To Irak bin Malik ne Hazrat Aishah se bayan kiya: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne 'apne baitul khala ka qible ki taraf rukh karne ka hukm diya.' Aur beshak log use makrooh samajhte hain."
